   490 suppliers with at least one address field (address/city/PO box).

   Run in the target database. Per the user's standing rule, run on dev SYNERP first, then the restored
   copy, then prod - never straight to prod.

   IDEMPOTENT by SupplierName: re-running this script skips any supplier whose name already exists in
   PROJ.TBL_SUPPLIER, so it is safe to run twice on the same database. Contacts and the address are only
   inserted for suppliers that were newly created in THIS run - if a supplier already existed, its
   contacts/address are left untouched (rerun a targeted fix separately if one needs updating).

   Assumptions made (per the user's answers, 2026-09-29) - check these before running on a restored/prod copy:
     - CurrencyId = 2 (AED) for every migrated supplier (source suppliers are UAE vendors).
