       match; the original text is preserved in Remarks.
     - IsActive = 1 for every migrated supplier (user: "All 490 = Active"), regardless of the source
       SupplierStatusId (no matching lookup table existed in the source database to interpret it).
     - SupplierType = the source industry name (free text; no clean 1:1 map to PROJ.TBL_SUPPLIER_CATEGORY's
       4 categories) - SupplierCategoryId is left NULL for the user to set later if wanted.
     - Country resolved by NAME from the source's TBL_COUNTRY (11 distinct values, all matched):
       China=42, Czech Republic=52, Egypt=59, France=70, Germany=75, India=92, KSA(Saudi Arabia)=177,
       Netherlands=141, Singapore=182, UAE=216, USA=218.
   ===================================================================================================== */
